# Godot's regenerable import/editor/shader cache; keep source .uid files.
.godot/
# Rebuildable Windows/Android/macOS packages; keep export presets and tools.
build/
# Offline and LAN variants use build/<platform>/ and build/<platform>-lan/.
# Build-option/menu regression evidence lives in artifacts/build-options-2026-11-08/;
# temporary menu-test sandboxes under tmp/package-menu-test-* clean themselves.
# Restored Mahjong voice QA logs/screenshots use artifacts/mahjong-voice-2026-11-08/.
# Superseded copies remain after automatic approval blocked their cleanup;
# final evidence uses ui-final/, package-*-final/ and full-tests-release.log.
# Keep original MP3s and historical generated WAV sources tracked; exclude the
# inactive assets/audio/characters/* from export presets, not from source control.
# Touch-inspection/credit QA screenshots and logs use artifacts/touch-inspection-2026-11-08/.
# Keep source regression tests and reviewed verification notes; packages remain in build/.
# Windows motion bridge DLL, objects, linker outputs: rebuilt by
# tools/build_native.ps1 from native/windows sources; exported copies ship in
# build/windows beside the EXE. They are generated binaries, not source assets.
/native/windows/bin/
/native/windows/build/
# Local QA screenshots, previews and performance captures, plus user-delivered
# art archives (including raw originals, alternate candidates and upscaled copies).
# IMPORTANT: art-delivery-*/raw and the supplied source images are NOT rebuildable
# from the scripts. Keep a separate local backup; do not clean them as caches.
# Commit selected runtime images under assets/, preparation tools, source hashes
# in assets/art_manifest.json and reviewed results in docs/verification.md instead.
# Dou Dizhu Guofeng 2026-11-06 raw PNG/JPG delivery is also irreplaceable;
# its verified backup lives in ../山东麻将-美术备份/. Track runtime cards and
# assets/licenses/doudizhu-guofeng-manifest.json, not the raw archive.
# Window/fullscreen QA screenshots and render/resize benchmark JSON also belong
# here; commit their reproducible tests and reviewed measurements, not captures.
# Bluff 0.8 QA screenshots, packaged-game captures and speech-generation logs
# live in artifacts/bluff-2026-11-06/. Keep reviewed results in docs/verification.md;
# commit assets/bluff/audio, its hash manifest and reproducible tests/tools.
# Bluff 0.8.1 recorder/history/timing captures and package logs use
# artifacts/bluff-refinement-2026-11-06/; keep their source tests and reviewed
# results in Git, not machine-generated screenshots or installers.
# Bluff 0.8.2 memory/AI and multirow verification use
# artifacts/bluff-ai-2026-11-06/; retain final QA evidence locally.
# Poker 0.8.3 low-hand/consent QA uses artifacts/poker-low-hand-2026-11-07/.
# Keep final evidence locally; source tests, eight new runtime WAVs and their
# provenance manifests belong in Git. Packages remain under ignored build/.
# Mutation 0.9 QA captures, native-exit diagnostics and package checks live in
# artifacts/field-mutation-2026-11-07/. Track source tests, fixed replay fixtures
# and reviewed verification notes; installers and local captures stay excluded.
artifacts/
# Future MiniMax web TTS master downloads belong in
# artifacts/audio-delivery-bluff-minimax-2026-11-12/. Keep and separately back up
# these originals; they are not temporary caches. Track reviewed final clips
# and their provenance after delivery, plus docs/bluff-minimax-tts/ scripts now.
# Bluff 0.10.1 strategy comparison, full-suite logs and package captures use
# artifacts/bluff-strategy-2026-11-07/. Retain final QA evidence locally;
# keep reproducible source tests and reviewed results in Git. The temporary
# archived baseline under tmp/bluff-strategy-2026-11-07/ is disposable after QA;
# this run's cleanup was blocked before execution, so it remains local only.
# User-delivered character originals, two explicitly temporary meme stand-ins,
# and original generation prompts. Keep this folder and its verified external
# backup; these are not caches. Curated circular PNGs and the replacement map
# in assets/licenses/character-art-manifest.json belong in Git.
/头像生成/
# Superseded procedural cloth/floor previews are reproducible with
# tools/make_table_texture.py. Keep local copies for design comparison;
# the delivered cloth and courtyard are the runtime assets tracked in Git.
/assets/textures/felt.png
/assets/textures/felt.png.import
/assets/textures/room_floor.png
/assets/textures/room_floor.png.import
# Downloaded Godot/export templates, scratch files and repeatable test outputs.
# Field-rule build logs and headless multi-process package probes also use tmp/;
# retain source tests and verification notes, and clean only the current run.
# Dou Dizhu voice-generation models/dependencies and download scratch also use
# tmp/ddz-audio-research-*/; keep only runtime WAVs, license/source manifests,
# generation tools and reviewed evidence. Clean this task's scratch after use.
tmp/
*.log
# Exported release archives and device install packages are delivery artifacts.
*.apk
*.aab
*.pck
# APK v4 signature sidecars are generated with installers and stay local too.
*.apk.idsig
# Local IDE and operating system files.
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# Signing identities and local machine paths must never enter Git.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.keystore
*.jks
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
export_credentials.cfg
local.settings.json
# Optional development-only Python / Node environments.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
node_modules/
